## 2. .gitignore

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Environment variables
.env

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak

# Testing cache
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Jangan abaikan file data dan hasil rekap proyek